"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"closure’s determinism law, and is carried so that reading it calls nothing."}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Index","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"ImplicitDirectedGraph.Edges.Index"}}}